<title>USA: Abacus Direct CFO Karl Friedman resigns.</title>
<headline>Abacus Direct CFO Karl Friedman resigns.</headline>
<dateline>WESTMINSTER, Colo. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abacus Direct Corp said on Tuesday Karl Friedman, the chief financial officer, has resigned to pursue his interests in early stage ventures and philanthropic work.</p>
<p>The company said Friedman had served as senior vice president, chief financial officer, secretary, treasurer and a director since he co-founded the company in 1989.</p>
<p>He plans to stay at Abacus Direct until a replacement is found, the company said.</p>
